@startuml Workwear Compensation Calculation Process

title Workwear Compensation Calculation Process

|System|
start
:Detect expired assignments;

|#AntiqueWhite|Compensation Service|
:Find all assignments that are:
- Expired (expiryDate before today)
- Not already compensated
- Not issued to employee
- Marked as eligible for compensation;

partition "Process Eligible Assignments" {
  while (More eligible assignments?) is (yes)

    :Get next eligible assignment;

    |#LightBlue|Validation|
    if (Was assignment issued to employee?) then (yes)
      :Skip assignment;
    else (no)
      if (Compensation already exists for employee and clothing type?) then (yes)
        :Log skipping - compensation exists;
      else (no)
        |#LightGreen|Compensation Creation|

        :<b>Begin Transaction</b>;
        note right
          Transaction ensures data consistency
          during compensation creation
        end note

        :Calculate compensation amount
        based on clothing allowance;

        :Create new compensation record:
        - Employee reference
        - Assignment reference
        - Amount and dates
        - Status = PENDING;

        :Save compensation to database;

        |#LightYellow|Assignment Update|
        :Set assignment status = COMPENSATED;
        :Set eligibleForCompensation = false;
        :Save assignment;

        |#LightPink|New Assignment Creation|
        :Create new assignment for same clothing type:
        - Same employee
        - Start today, expiry from validity
        - PENDING status
        - Not issued;

        :Save new assignment;

        :<b>Commit Transaction</b>;
        :Increment created count;
      endif
    endif
  endwhile
}

|System|
:Return total number of compensations created;

stop
@enduml